arcinomatosis.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="tbl3" position="float"><label>Table 3</label><caption><p content-type="table-title">Univariate analysis with respect to overall survival in 80 patients of curative R0 resection</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1" width="85%"><colgroup><col align="left"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Parameter</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Risk ratio</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>95&#x00025; confidence interval</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold><italic>P</italic>-value</bold></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>RT&#x02014;PCR(CEA and/or CK20)</italic></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">9.2</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">3.0&#x02013;28.5</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x0003c;0.001</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Negative <italic>vs</italic> positive</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>Tumour depth</italic></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">11.1</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">2.4&#x02013;50.1</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.02</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;T1/T2 <italic>vs</italic> T3/T4</td><td align="center" valign="top